    "Reason : 1 - The proposed eaves height of the garage would exceed the height of the eaves of the existing dwellinghouse. It would therefore not be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class A, A.1.d of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended). ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed alterations to the garage roof would be within 2 metres of the boundary of the curtilage of the dwellinghouse, and the height of the eaves of the garage roof would exceed 3 metres. It would therefore not be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class A, A.1.i of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal is NOT therefor a lawful development."
